---
---

<section class="how-help section" id="how-help">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section__label gsap-fade-up" data-en="Our Services" data-hi="हमारी सेवाएँ">Our Services</span>
    <h2 class="section__title gsap-fade-up">
      <span data-en="How Can I" data-hi="मैं आपकी कैसे">How Can I</span> <span class="text-gradient" data-en="Help You?" data-hi="मदद कर सकता हूँ?">Help You?</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="section__subtitle gsap-fade-up" data-en="Every journey is different. Here's how expert health coaches guide their clients from struggle to success, backed by behavioral psychology and nutritional science." data-hi="हर सफ़र अलग है। यहाँ बताया गया है कि कैसे विशेषज्ञ स्वास्थ्य कोच व्यवहार मनोविज्ञान और पोषण विज्ञान के आधार पर अपने क्लाइंट्स को संघर्ष से सफलता तक ले जाते हैं।">
      Every journey is different. Here's how expert health coaches guide their 
      clients from struggle to success, backed by behavioral psychology and nutritional science.
    </p>

    <div class="how-help__grid gsap-stagger-parent">
      <div class="how-help__card gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="how-help__card-header">
          <div class="how-help__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
              <path d="M14 2v6h6"/>
              <path d="M16 13H8"/>
              <path d="M16 17H8"/>
              <path d="M10 9H8"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="how-help__card-tag" data-en="Core Service" data-hi="मुख्य सेवा">Core Service</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="how-help__card-title" data-en="Personalized Diet Planning" data-hi="व्यक्तिगत डाइट प्लानिंग">Personalized Diet Planning</h3>
        <p class="how-help__card-text" data-en="A customized meal plan tailored to your body type, metabolic rate, food preferences, and cultural eating habits. We calculate your exact caloric needs and create macro-optimized plans that you'll actually enjoy following." data-hi="आपके शरीर के प्रकार, मेटाबॉलिक दर, खाने की पसंद और सांस्कृतिक खान-पान की आदतों के अनुसार एक अनुकूलित भोजन योजना। हम आपकी सटीक कैलोरी ज़रूरतों की गणना करते हैं और मैक्रो-ऑप्टिमाइज़्ड प्लान बनाते हैं जिन्हें फ़ॉलो करने में आपको मज़ा आएगा।">
          A customized meal plan tailored to your body type, metabolic rate, food preferences, 
          and cultural eating habits. We calculate your exact caloric needs and create 
          macro-optimized plans that you'll actually enjoy following.
        </p>
        <ul class="how-help__card-features">
          <li><span data-en="Calorie & macro calculation" data-hi="कैलोरी और मैक्रो गणना">Calorie & macro calculation</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Meal timing optimization" data-hi="भोजन समय अनुकूलन">Meal timing optimization</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Vegetarian/Non-veg options" data-hi="शाकाहारी/मांसाहारी विकल्प">Vegetarian/Non-veg options</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="how-help__card gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="how-help__card-header">
          <div class="how-help__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="how-help__card-tag" data-en="Guidance" data-hi="मार्गदर्शन">Guidance</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="how-help__card-title" data-en="1-on-1 Lifestyle Coaching" data-hi="1-ऑन-1 जीवनशैली कोचिंग">1-on-1 Lifestyle Coaching</h3>
        <p class="how-help__card-text" data-en="Behavioral psychology shows that accountability is the #1 predictor of success. Through regular coaching sessions, we address stress eating, emotional triggers, sleep patterns, and help you build sustainable habits through habit stacking." data-hi="व्यवहार मनोविज्ञान दिखाता है कि जवाबदेही सफलता का सबसे बड़ा संकेतक है। नियमित कोचिंग सत्रों के माध्यम से, हम तनाव में खाना, भावनात्मक ट्रिगर, नींद के पैटर्न को संबोधित करते हैं और हैबिट स्टैकिंग के ज़रिए टिकाऊ आदतें बनाने में मदद करते हैं।">
          Behavioral psychology shows that accountability is the #1 predictor of success. 
          Through regular coaching sessions, we address stress eating, emotional triggers, 
          sleep patterns, and help you build sustainable habits through habit stacking.
        </p>
        <ul class="how-help__card-features">
          <li><span data-en="Behavioral pattern analysis" data-hi="व्यवहार पैटर्न विश्लेषण">Behavioral pattern analysis</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Stress & sleep management" data-hi="तनाव और नींद प्रबंधन">Stress & sleep management</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Habit stacking methodology" data-hi="हैबिट स्टैकिंग पद्धति">Habit stacking methodology</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="how-help__card gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="how-help__card-header">
          <div class="how-help__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="how-help__card-tag" data-en="Tracking" data-hi="ट्रैकिंग">Tracking</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="how-help__card-title" data-en="Progress Monitoring" data-hi="प्रगति निगरानी">Progress Monitoring</h3>
        <p class="how-help__card-text" data-en="What gets measured gets managed. We track your weight, body measurements, energy levels, and adherence weekly. Based on your progress data, plans are dynamically adjusted to ensure you're always moving toward your goal." data-hi="जो मापा जाता है, वह प्रबंधित होता है। हम आपके वज़न, शरीर माप, ऊर्जा स्तर और पालन को साप्ताहिक रूप से ट्रैक करते हैं। आपकी प्रगति डेटा के आधार पर, योजनाओं को गतिशील रूप से समायोजित किया जाता है ताकि आप हमेशा अपने लक्ष्य की ओर बढ़ें।">
          What gets measured gets managed. We track your weight, body measurements, 
          energy levels, and adherence weekly. Based on your progress data, plans are 
          dynamically adjusted to ensure you're always moving toward your goal.
        </p>
        <ul class="how-help__card-features">
          <li><span data-en="Weekly body metrics tracking" data-hi="साप्ताहिक बॉडी मेट्रिक्स ट्रैकिंग">Weekly body metrics tracking</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Dynamic plan adjustments" data-hi="गतिशील योजना समायोजन">Dynamic plan adjustments</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Progress photo comparisons" data-hi="प्रगति फ़ोटो तुलना">Progress photo comparisons</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="how-help__card gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="how-help__card-header">
          <div class="how-help__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="how-help__card-tag" data-en="Support" data-hi="सहायता">Support</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="how-help__card-title" data-en="Ongoing Accountability" data-hi="निरंतर जवाबदेही">Ongoing Accountability</h3>
        <p class="how-help__card-text" data-en="Research shows people are 65% more likely to achieve a goal with an accountability partner. We provide daily check-ins via WhatsApp, weekly review calls, and are always available to answer questions and keep you motivated." data-hi="शोध दिखाता है कि जवाबदेही साथी के साथ लोगों का लक्ष्य हासिल करने की संभावना 65% अधिक होती है। हम WhatsApp के ज़रिए दैनिक चेक-इन, साप्ताहिक रिव्यू कॉल प्रदान करते हैं, और सवालों के जवाब देने और आपको प्रेरित रखने के लिए हमेशा उपलब्ध रहते हैं।">
          Research shows people are 65% more likely to achieve a goal with an accountability 
          partner. We provide daily check-ins via WhatsApp, weekly review calls, and are 
          always available to answer questions and keep you motivated.
        </p>
        <ul class="how-help__card-features">
          <li><span data-en="Daily WhatsApp check-ins" data-hi="दैनिक WhatsApp चेक-इन">Daily WhatsApp check-ins</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="Weekly video consultations" data-hi="साप्ताहिक वीडियो परामर्श">Weekly video consultations</span></li>
          <li><span data-en="24/7 doubt resolution" data-hi="24/7 संदेह समाधान">24/7 doubt resolution</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .how-help {
    background: $color-bg-primary;
    position: relative;

    &__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: $space-8;

      @include respond-to('md') {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      @include respond-to('xl') {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: $space-6;
      }
    }

    &__card {
      @include card-base;
      padding: $space-8;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;

      &::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        height: 3px;
        background: $gradient-primary;
        transform: scaleX(0);
        transform-origin: left;
        transition: transform $transition-smooth;
      }

      &:hover::before {
        transform: scaleX(1);
      }

      &:hover {
        .how-help__card-icon {
          background: rgba($color-accent-emerald, 0.15);
          transform: scale(1.1);
        }
      }

      &-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin-bottom: $space-6;
      }

      &-icon {
        @include flex-center;
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        background: rgba($color-accent-emerald, 0.08);
        border-radius: $radius-lg;
        color: $color-accent-emerald;
        transition: all $transition-smooth;
      }

      &-tag {
        font-size: $fs-xs;
        font-weight: $fw-medium;
        color: $color-accent-gold;
        background: rgba($color-accent-gold, 0.1);
        padding: $space-1 $space-3;
        border-radius: $radius-full;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: $ls-wide;
      }

      &-title {
        @include heading($fs-lg);
        margin-bottom: $space-3;
      }

      &-text {
        @include body-text($fs-sm);
        margin-bottom: $space-6;
        flex: 1;
      }

      &-features {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: $space-2;
        padding-top: $space-4;
        border-top: 1px solid $color-border;

        li {
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          gap: $space-2;
          font-size: $fs-sm;
          color: $color-text-secondary;

          &::before {
            content: '✓';
            color: $color-accent-emerald;
            font-weight: $fw-bold;
            font-size: $fs-xs;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>
